# Accepted findings - each one is a requirement of the assignment or an AWS limitation.

# Public ALB is internet-facing: the frontend must be exposed to the internet.
AVD-AWS-0053

# Plain-HTTP listener: only the INTERNAL backend ALB forwards HTTP, inside the VPC
# (frontend SG -> ALB SG -> backend SG). The public ALB's :80 only redirects to HTTPS.
AVD-AWS-0054

# ALB access-log buckets use SSE-S3: ALB log delivery supports only SSE-S3, not SSE-KMS.
AVD-AWS-0132
